cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software in research, please cite it as below."
title: "AI Chat Exporter"
abstract: >-
  A Firefox extension that exports conversations from ChatGPT, Claude,
  Copilot, Perplexity, Grok, DeepSeek, Mistral, Microsoft 365 Copilot,
  and Google Search's AI Overview / AI Mode as CSV files. All processing
  happens locally in the donor's browser; nothing is sent to a remote
  server. Designed for data-donation studies in digital methods and
  computational social science.
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "Jurg"
    given-names: "Daniel"
    affiliation: "Vrije Universiteit Brussel"
    email: "daniel.jurg@vub.be"
repository-code: "https://github.com/dj-urg/ai-mirror-export"
url: "https://addons.mozilla.org/firefox/addon/local-ai-chat-exporter/"
version: "3.0.0"
keywords:
  - data donation
  - digital methods
  - computational social science
  - AI chat
  - ChatGPT
  - Claude
  - browser extension
  - CSV export
